t">teaspoon</span> <span class="wprm-recipe-ingredient-name">Kosher salt</span></li><li class="wprm-recipe-ingredient" style="list-style-type: disc;" data-uid="13"><span class="wprm-recipe-ingredient-amount">&frac14;</span> <span class="wprm-recipe-ingredient-unit">teaspoon</span> <span class="wprm-recipe-ingredient-name">black pepper</span></li></ul></div><div class="wprm-recipe-ingredient-group"><h4 class="wprm-recipe-group-name wprm-recipe-ingredient-group-name wprm-block-text-bold">As Garnish</h4><ul class="wprm-recipe-ingredients"><li class="wprm-recipe-ingredient" style="list-style-type: disc;" data-uid="15"><span class="wprm-recipe-ingredient-amount">&frac14;</span> <span class="wprm-recipe-ingredient-unit">cup</span> <span class="wprm-recipe-ingredient-name">pomegranate arils</span></li><li class="wprm-recipe-ingredient" style="list-style-type: disc;" data-uid="16"><span class="wprm-recipe-ingredient-amount">&frac12;</span> <span class="wprm-recipe-ingredient-unit">cup</span> <span class="wprm-recipe-ingredient-name">pine nuts</span> <span class="wprm-recipe-ingredient-notes wprm-recipe-ingredient-notes-faded">toasted</span></li><li class="wprm-recipe-ingredient" style="list-style-type: disc;" data-uid="17"><span class="wprm-recipe-ingredient-amount">2</span> <span class="wprm-recipe-ingredient-unit">tablespoons</span> <span class="wprm-recipe-ingredient-name"><a href="https://amzn.to/47bfwSW" class="wprm-recipe-ingredient-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow">pomegranate molasses</a></span> <span class="wprm-recipe-ingredient-notes wprm-recipe-ingredient-notes-faded">optional</span></li></ul></div></div>
<div id="recipe-84262-instructions" class="wprm-recipe-instructions-container wprm-recipe-84262-instructions-container wprm-block-text-normal" data-recipe="84262"><h3 class="wprm-recipe-header wprm-recipe-instructions-header wprm-block-text-bold wprm-align-left wprm-header-decoration-none" style="">Instructions</h3><div class="wprm-recipe-instruction-group"><ul class="wprm-recipe-instructions"><li id="wprm-recipe-84262-step-0-0" class="wprm-recipe-instruction" style="list-style-type: decimal;"><div class="wprm-recipe-instruction-text" style="margin-bottom: 5px;"><span style="display: block;">Preheat oven to 425 &deg;F/204 &deg;C. Line a rimmed baking sheet with parchement paper.</span></div></li><li id="wprm-recipe-84262-step-0-1" class="wprm-recipe-instruction" style="list-style-type: decimal;"><div class="wprm-recipe-instruction-text" style="margin-bottom: 5px;"><span style="display: block;">Place Brussels sprouts on the sheet pan. Drizzle them with olive oil and sprinkle them with paprika, ground cumin, salt, and pepper. </span></div><div class="wprm-recipe-instruction-media wprm-recipe-instruction-image"><img decoding="async" width="400" height="248" src="https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/Sheet-pan-brussel-sprouts-400x248.jpg" class="attachment-medium size-medium" alt="Person seasoning Brussels sprouts on a sheet pan." srcset="https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/Sheet-pan-brussel-sprouts-400x248.jpg 400w, https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/Sheet-pan-brussel-sprouts-768x476.jpg 768w, https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/Sheet-pan-brussel-sprouts-150x93.jpg 150w, https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/Sheet-pan-brussel-sprouts.jpg 1200w" sizes="(max-width: 400px) 100vw, 400px" data-pin-media="https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/Sheet-pan-brussel-sprouts.jpg"></div> </li><li id="wprm-recipe-84262-step-0-2" class="wprm-recipe-instruction" style="list-style-type: decimal;"><div class="wprm-recipe-instruction-text" style="margin-bottom: 5px;"><span style="display: block;">Give it a good toss to ensure that the sprouts are evenly coated with everything. Arrange the Brussels sprouts cut side down and roast them for 20 minutes, tossing them halfway through.</span></div><div class="wprm-recipe-instruction-media wprm-recipe-instruction-image"><img decoding="async" width="400" height="248" src="https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/Baking-brussel-sprouts-400x248.jpg" class="attachment-medium size-medium" alt="Person arranging Brussels sprouts on a sheet pan." srcset="https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/Baking-brussel-sprouts-400x248.jpg 400w, https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/Baking-brussel-sprouts-768x476.jpg 768w, https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/Baking-brussel-sprouts-150x93.jpg 150w, https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/Baking-brussel-sprouts.jpg 1200w" sizes="(max-width: 400px) 100vw, 400px" data-pin-media="https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/Baking-brussel-sprouts.jpg"></div> </li><li id="wprm-recipe-84262-step-0-3" class="wprm-recipe-instruction" style="list-style-type: decimal;"><div class="wprm-recipe-instruction-text" style="margin-bottom: 5px;"><span style="display: block;">Remove from the oven and let them cool down while you are working on making the yogurt sauce.</span></div><div class="wprm-recipe-instruction-media wprm-recipe-instruction-image"><img decoding="async" width="400" height="248" src="https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/Brussel-sprouts-roasting-400x248.jpg" class="attachment-medium size-medium" alt="Crispy roasted Brussels sprouts on a sheet pan from the top view." srcset="https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/Brussel-sprouts-roasting-400x248.jpg 400w, https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/Brussel-sprouts-roasting-768x476.jpg 768w, https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/Brussel-sprouts-roasting-150x93.jpg 150w, https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/Brussel-sprouts-roasting.jpg 1200w" sizes="(max-width: 400px) 100vw, 400px" data-pin-media="https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/Brussel-sprouts-roasting.jpg"></div> </li><li id="wprm-recipe-84262-step-0-4" class="wprm-recipe-instruction" style="list-style-type: decimal;"><div class="wprm-recipe-instruction-text" style="margin-bottom: 5px;">While the sprouts are roasting, make the tahini sauce. In a medium bowl, whisk together yogurt, tahini, lemon juice, garlic, salt, and pepper.</div><div class="wprm-recipe-instruction-media wprm-recipe-instruction-image"><img decoding="async" width="400" height="248" src="https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/Mediterranean-roasted-brussel-sprout-recipe-400x248.jpg" class="attachment-medium size-medium" alt="Two images side by side showing the making and spreading of the yogurt tahini sauce." srcset="https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/Mediterranean-roasted-brussel-sprout-recipe-400x248.jpg 400w, https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/Mediterranean-roasted-brussel-sprout-recipe-768x476.jpg 768w, https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/Mediterranean-roasted-brussel-sprout-recipe-150x93.jpg 150w, https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/Mediterranean-roasted-brussel-sprout-recipe.jpg 1200w" sizes="(max-width: 400px) 100vw, 400px" data-pin-media="https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/Mediterranean-roasted-brussel-sprout-recipe.jpg"></div> </li><li id="wprm-recipe-84262-step-0-5" class="wprm-recipe-instruction" style="list-style-type: decimal;"><div class="wprm-recipe-instruction-text" style="margin-bottom: 5px;"><span style="display: block;">When ready to assemble, spread the yogurt sauce on a serving platter. Arrange the Brussels sprouts over the top. Sprinkle them with toasted pine nuts and pomegranate arils. If using, finish it off with a drizzle of pomegranate molasses.</span></div><div class="wprm-recipe-instruction-media wprm-recipe-instruction-image"><img decoding="async" width="400" height="248" src="https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/Roasting-brussel-sprouts-in-oven-400x248.jpg" class="attachment-medium size-medium" alt="A collage of images showing the roasted Brussels sprouts being assembled." srcset="https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/Roasting-brussel-sprouts-in-oven-400x248.jpg 400w, https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/Roasting-brussel-sprouts-in-oven-768x476.jpg 768w, https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/Roasting-brussel-sprouts-in-oven-150x93.jpg 150w, https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/Roasting-brussel-sprouts-in-oven.jpg 1200w" sizes="(max-width: 400px) 100vw, 400px" data-pin-media="https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/Roasting-brussel-sprouts-in-oven.jpg"></div> </li></ul></div></div>
